{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1274381-how-would-you-make-this-treasure-work","id":1274381,"title":"How would you make this treasure work.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-12-14T10:11:32-08:00","id":1274381,"title":"How would you make this treasure work.","content":"A while back, someone in one of my old threads on this part of the forums gave me a good suggestion for a Treasure for a story i am planning on writing soon . He suggested that my character, a PI, be given a Treasure that could allow him to see the Changeling's world without having to be constantly enchanted like in the past. I liked this idea and have decided to roll with it. My idea know is a pair of sunglasses that allow the user to see both Changeling's true forms and the Dreaming itself. <br /> <br /> How would you make this Treasure work both mechanically and in-universe wise?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-14T11:43:20-08:00","id":1274410,"title":"","content":"In second edition, being in physical contact with any treasure enchanted a person. I can't remember if that got carried over to C20 or not, but if it didn't, I wouldn't make the effect more complicated than just &quot;enchants a person while they're in physical contact with it.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-15T06:08:00-08:00","id":1274548,"title":"","content":"The description of the Treassure Background in C20 actually states that Treassures protect Changelings from forgetting their nature and enchant mortals on touch.<br /> As a Storyteller, I don't like these rules. It would be way more complicated in my games.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13221-thevarulfen","name":"TheVarulfen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-16T13:07:06-08:00","id":1274760,"title":"","content":"Yup treasures enchant on touch, that way they can affect people without worrying about if your sword is hitting an enchanted mortal or not.<br /> <br /> And the Near Dreaming is complicated thing, it\u2019s not like the Penumbra where it is a direct reflection of Earth. In fact if you had a constant view of the Dreaming it would likely shape the Dreaming.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-16T13:32:22-08:00","id":1274764,"title":"","content":"I would make it a magnifying glass. But I may be showing my age.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13395-daniel-knight","name":"Daniel Knight","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"96"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-16T13:36:37-08:00","id":1274766,"title":"","content":"Maybe a Zippo Lighter that lets you peer into people\u2019s dreams and the near Dreaming when smoking.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-16T14:02:44-08:00","id":1274770,"title":"","content":"Like said the Treasure could be anything you want since all Treasures enchant their owners.<br /> <br /> I\u2019ve had some hilarity ensue due to this as a certain players Nocker caught some unwanted attention from the police and had his car and bags searched, he was certain they would find nothing untill one of the officers took his Treasure, a Goblin Bow (Kithbook: Nockers), from his bag thus accidentally enchanting himself and suddenly seeing that the harmless object he picked up was actually a weapon and that the suspect had transformed into some weird looking big eared clown...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1629-possessed","name":"Possessed","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1629_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-16T19:14:14-08:00","id":1274821,"title":"","content":"Augmented reality item.. because well...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}